<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod index down 0.3 pct yr/yr Nov 96.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod index down 0.3 pct yr/yr Nov 96.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production fell 0.3 percent year-on-year in November, while month-on-month it rose 0.1 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					  Nov 96	Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p>General Index			 103.6	 103.5	 103.09</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	   -0.3	  -0.6</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	   +0.1	  -1.8</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	     +1.7	  +2.1</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>Extractive industry		 86.8	  80.8	    87.6</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry	   102.6	 104.4	    98.4</p>
</text>
